      "value": "<p>The AT-12 Raider is a compact shotgun favored by Cerberus assault troopers for its reliability and ease of use in close-quarters combat. Its dual-fire mechanism releases two shells per trigger pull in rapid succession, trading ammunition efficiency for a burst of kinetic scatter that overwhelms point-defense systems before they can cycle. Fast, aggressive, and designed for attackers who intend to win the first second of an engagement.</p>"
